


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_b6145f2d:


    "空气中充斥着令人尴尬的沉默。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_1627d6fb:


    "当然两人都已经整理好衣冠了，但是……"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_27bcf91d:



    voice "RIN_1462"
    rin "「嘤嘤嘤……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_0437e06e:


    "有个人一直用双手捂着脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_60a13c4e:


    "确实在这三人当中，就只有她被看到最羞耻的样子了。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_66649536:



    voice "HIN_1516"
    hina "「嗯，也是呢。再怎么说也有点同情你了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_9dc946e9:


    "看着她，阳菜抱歉地挠了挠鬓角。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_13772033:



    voice "HIN_1517"
    hina "「就说最近总感觉有点奇怪」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_2b4a57fa:



    voice "FUM_1289"
    fumi "「对不起。总是找不到说出来的时机」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_0fc8ba49:


    "文十分抱歉地咬着嘴唇。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_56bfc14a:



    voice "HIN_1518"
    hina "「没事。你们两个人交往是你们的自由。不需要在意我的」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_41ffff0e:



    voice "FUM_1290"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_d595e15c:



    voice "HIN_1519"
    hina "「不过，原来伦在下面啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_b4db264f:



    voice "RIN_1463"
    rin "「呜哇啊啊啊啊！！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_22d77844:


    "文抓住了想要飞奔出去的伦的衣襟。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_639aca71:



    voice "FUM_1291"
    fumi "「那个，今天这件事是因为我一时心起的恶作剧而已，并没有决定今后的主导权会如何……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_b127110c:



    voice "FUM_1292"
    fumi "「但是，伦……绪方同学的反应比想象中还要好所以……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_a8233d50:



    voice "HIN_1520"
    hina "「不，那个就不用详细说明了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_dc14b539:



    voice "RIN_1464"
    rin "「啊啊啊啊啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_2203e4ac:


    "地狱？还是奖励？"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_1414e42c:



    voice "HIN_1521"
    hina "「这个暂且不说。现在我知道你们俩的关系了。虽然不知道该怎么说……总之先恭喜」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_e937a46a:



    voice "RIN_1465"
    rin "「……只是这样？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_409f1833:



    voice "HIN_1522"
    hina "「只是这样，是什么意思？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_6b660b7f:



    voice "RIN_1466"
    rin "「我以为你会更生气」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_74924be8:



    voice "HIN_1523"
    hina "「为什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_5a4deb7c:



    voice "RIN_1467"
    rin "「阳菜，你对这方面不是很严格嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_56d8fdb2:



    voice "HIN_1524"
    hina "「刚才也说了交往是个人自由，交往过后做那种事也……是理所应当的吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_188a4fb1:



    voice "HIN_1525"
    hina "「基于爱情的行为，谁也没有对此生气的权利」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_4419b2e2:



    voice "FUM_1293"
    fumi "「夏目同学……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_5e7052dc:



    voice "RIN_1468"
    rin "「一直以为很幼稚的阳菜居然说出这么成熟的话……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_10ad695e:



    voice "HIN_1526"
    hina "「闭嘴，抖M」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_de0417aa:



    voice "RIN_1469"
    rin "「嘤嘤嘤……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_c52c8dfb:



    voice "HIN_1527"
    hina "「不过……我还是从房间搬出去吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_8951fed7:


    rin_fumi "「诶！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_bbe84de7:



    voice "HIN_1528"
    hina "「因为你看，我不想妨碍你们啊。而且知道了以后也会很在意」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_443b6070:



    voice "HIN_1529"
    hina "「回到宿舍后会跟祥子姐商量看看的。如果这栋宿舍没有空房间的话，就搬到别的宿舍——」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_2f32ee13:



    voice "FUM_1295"
    fumi "「不行！不能搬出去！我想要三个人在一起！」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_2182bd90:


    "文用两只手紧紧握住阳菜的手。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_46cb6e6c:



    voice "HIN_1530"
    hina "「……浅生」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_2508bd68:



    voice "FUM_1296"
    fumi "「夏目同学要是讨厌的话，我和伦在房间里就不黏在一起。伦也可以忍耐吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_3255e050:



    voice "RIN_1471"
    rin "「诶，啊，可以」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_48140cd7:



    voice "HIN_1531"
    hina "「不……在我看不见的地方倒还好。话说回来，有我在你们俩不会觉得碍事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_04acd263:



    voice "RIN_1472"
    rin "「阳菜要是搬出去我也会很困扰……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_2d522b56:



    voice "HIN_1532"
    hina "「因为会被浅生欺负？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_2a896b04:



    voice "RIN_1473"
    rin "「所，以，说」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_7f7f7ab5:



    voice "RIN_1474"
    rin "「如果阳菜非得搬出去的话，那我就和文回到原来的关系。{size=15}……到毕业为止{/size}」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_7d63d9d9:


    "伦这么说着瞄了一眼文的脸。文微笑着点了点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_552d516a:



    voice "HIN_1533"
    hina "「什么嘛，那种讲法，说得我很严苛一样」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_c917b3a9:



    voice "HIN_1534"
    hina "「……你们都不在意的话，我也想和你们在一起啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_602c1e6b:


    "阳菜流着泪笑了。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_4c1d1a19:



    voice "FUM_1297"
    fumi "「我想要夏目同学留下来」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_18a6b86c:



    voice "RIN_1475"
    rin "「之前说过了吧，我的甜蜜家庭计划」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_610001dc:



    voice "HIN_1535"
    hina "「伦，浅生……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_e890f64e:


    "三人牵起手。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_af5c5371:



    voice "HIN_1536"
    hina "「浅生，伦就拜托你了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_3b2f393c:



    voice "FUM_1298"
    fumi "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_b962348c:



    voice "RIN_1476"
    rin "「为什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_0c9dc65b:



    voice "FUM_1299"
    fumi "「啊，对了！夏目同学也一起玩吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_cedf721b:



    voice "HIN_1537"
    hina "「别，别，别开玩笑了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou3_08_8415a25d:



    voice "RIN_1477"
    rin "「……实在看不出是开玩笑」"
